================================================================================
CHALLENGE 7: THE REQUEST COUNTER (AtomicInteger)
================================================================================
SCENARIO: You are counting total API hits. If you use 'count++', you will
lose data because 'count++' is actually 3 operations (Read, Add, Write).

1. Create 'private final AtomicInteger totalRequests = new AtomicInteger(0);'.
2. Start 50 threads.
3. Each thread should loop 1000 times and call 'totalRequests.incrementAndGet();'.
4. Join all threads and print the result.
5. EXPECTATION: Result must be exactly 50,000.
================================================================================